Overview of changes in version 0.4.00:

  - New game: Buraco
  - Switched to GCC 3
  - Using GTKMM2/GTK+ 2
  - Needs General library 0.7.0
  - Cards aint influenced by GTK-styles (as they are only images, not buttons)
  - Providing an icon for the window managers
  - Cards must now be in png-format (which allows to use KDE's cards directly)
  - Fixed bug in Hearts (Human could play any club in round 1)

Overview of changes in version 0.3.02:

  - Using XAttributeLabel2 in HeartsScore dialog
  - Hearts ends now at 100 points (and not 101)
  - Fixed bug in Hearts (played Queen of spades in round 1)

Overview of changes in version 0.3.01:

  - If a player reaches 100 points in Hearts, the score is cleared again
  - Hearts computer player improved
  - Exchange of cards is analogue to Windows version in turn with everyone
  - Documentation (of Hearts; also tranlations in german and spanish)
  - Fixes

Overview of changes in version 0.3.00:

  - Hearts implemented
  - Security check if user closes the application while a game is running
  - Application shows the actual game type in the title bar
  - Posibility to inspect the won cards
  - Games show names of the players (which can be changed)
  - Program understands options from the command line
  - Spanish messages improved
  - Dialog to select the browser to use
  - INI-file can contain more options (like browser and help-dir)
  - Display help to the program or to the running game (by pressing F1)

Overview of changes in version 0.2.00:

  - Combined the games in one application
  - Security check if user terminates while a game is running
  - Playing of computer improved (both games)
  - Computer-player moves cards to the end of the staple before playing
  - Dialog to select carddecks improved (adapts size to show all decks)

Overview of changes in version 0.1.03:

  - Twopart got computer-player
  - Carddecks separated; can be changed during the game
  - Improved Røvhult's computer player

Overview of changes in version 0.1.02:

  - Documentation for Røvhult & Twopart added
  - Fixes within Røvhult
  - Twopart finished without computer-player

Overview of changes in version 0.1.01:

  - Interationalization
  - Røvhult got computer-player
  - Cardpiles display number of cards if mouse stops over (like tooltips)

Overview of changes in version 0.1.00:

  - Røvhult finished without computer-player
